# Root control-plane credential for the worker control agent only.
# Provision on the worker as /opt/sea-speed-worker/control.env (adjust for a
# custom install root): a regular file (no symlink), owner root:root, mode
# 0600, under the root-owned install root and OUTSIDE the service-user-owned
# shared/ tree, so the data-plane account can neither read, nor replace, nor
# rename the credential's directory. The installer rejects anything else.
# Never commit the populated file. This token is separate from the
# data-plane SEA_SPEED_API_TOKEN in worker.env and must be a distinct value.
SEA_SPEED_WORKER_CONTROL_TOKEN=
# Optional private listen address for the control agent (default
# 10.123.239.102:19001). Must stay inside a private RFC1918 range and never
# be exposed publicly.
# SEA_SPEED_WORKER_CONTROL_LISTEN=10.123.239.102:19001
